    [button "Save"]
    Recommended routing
    Based on the probed capability of each detected local model, its parameter count, and whatever VRAM the legacy Hardware profile reports. Apply via Plan & routing below.
    Phase 1 — GroundingCloudNo local backend detected — every phase routes to cloud.
    Phase 2 — AuditCloudNo local backend detected — every phase routes to cloud.
    Phase 3 — ChronicleCloudNo local backend detected — every phase routes to cloud.
