    [summary "Plan & routing— Pick a plan, or set each phase's model yourself." open] Plan & routing— Pick a plan, or set each phase's model yourself.
    Gemini Pro everywherebaseline [button "About Gemini Pro everywhere" expanded=false] [button "Apply"]
    The newest top-tier model on all five phases, including the mechanical ones. The yardstick every saving below is measured against.
    Gemini Pro prose + free grounding~40% cheaperestimated [button "About Gemini Pro prose + free grounding" expanded=false] [button "Apply" disabled]
    Chronicle and condense on Gemini Pro; grounding and audit move to Claude Code at no API cost.
