    OpenRouter prose + free grounding~94% cheaperestimated [button "About OpenRouter prose + free grounding" expanded=false] [button "Apply" disabled]
    Chronicle, extras and condense on OpenRouter; grounding and audit on Claude Code at no API cost. No Gemini key needed.
    Needs an OpenRouter key plus the Claude Code or Codex CLI on this machine.
    OpenRouter everywhere~93% cheaperestimated [button "About OpenRouter everywhere" expanded=false] [button "Apply"]
    All five phases on OpenRouter, each on the best model measured for that phase. One key, nothing else.
    Gemini Flash everywhere~77% cheapermeasuredRecommended [button "About Gemini Flash everywhere" expanded=false] [button "Apply"]
    All five phases on the latest Gemini Flash — the configuration that matched Pro in blind testing.
    Claude Code everywhereno API cost [button "About Claude Code everywhere" expanded=false] [button "Apply" disabled]
    All five phases run on Claude Code. No API keys, no per-token cost at all.
