      [button "vendor-b/model-smallOpenRouterC"]
      $0.011 this phase [button "Reset"]
      CondenseInherited
      Condenses the finished chronicle into a recap.
      Wants: Same prose judgement as Chronicle, over a shorter output.
      [button "gemini-2.5-proGemini Paid—"]
      $0.157 this phase
      Model reasoning, per phase
      Gemini phases only. Reasoning on = slower, sharper, ~3× the output cost; off = faster and cheaper. The Chronicle phase always keeps reasoning on. These save immediately.
