Grounding against 2 lore documents (64 chars).
Running with Google Gemini — Paid(2 keys configured) [button "Change in Settings →"]
01 Your transcript
Raw transcript
[button "Load .txt / .sbv"] [file-input accept=".txt,.sbv,.md"]
[textbox "Raw transcript" value="" placeholder="Paste your raw transcript here, or load a .sbv / .txt file…"]
0 characters
02 How it should read
Narrator
[combobox "Narrator" value="★ Persona-Two" options=["Bard (default)","──────────","★ Persona-One","★ Persona-Two","Persona-Custom"]] A wry narrator preset. [button "Manage"]
03 Run
