gemini-2.5-pro
Gemini
Load a transcript to see the estimated cost.
[button "Begin the Chronicle" disabled]
  [summary "Compare plan costs— what this transcript would cost on each Gemini plan." closed] Compare plan costs— what this transcript would cost on each Gemini plan.
  Cost estimator
  Load a transcript to see cost estimates per preset.
  [summary "Repair a caption file— fix names in a YouTube .sbv and export it corrected." closed] Repair a caption file— fix names in a YouTube .sbv and export it corrected.
  Caption Repair
  Upload a YouTube .sbv auto-caption file. Each cue is corrected against your Knowledge Base — names fixed, censored expletives restored, mature content preserved verbatim. Timestamps stay byte-for-byte identical so you can re-upload to YouTube directly. Knowledge Base: 2 docs.
  For mistranscriptions you've noticed yourself, edit src/data/corrections.ts — they'll be applied deterministically before any AI call.
  [button "Choose .sbv file"] [file-input accept=".sbv"]
  [summary "Saved chronicles— everything produced so far, and re-forging it." closed] Saved chronicles— everything produced so far, and re-forging it.
  Saved Chronicles
  Every finished run is auto-saved here and kept until you delete it — safe across reloads and restarts. Download what you need, then bin the rest.
  [button "Refresh"]
  [button "Campaign-One — Session 3<datetime> · 1,840 words · gemini · extrasgrounded transcript saved with this runchronicle saved with this run"] [button "Reforge"] [button "Delete chronicle"]
  [button "Campaign-One — Session 2<datetime> · 920 words · openrouter · condensedno grounded transcript saved with this runchronicle saved with this run"] [button "Reforge"] [button "Delete chronicle"]
  Reforge a Chronicle
  Redo extras / condense — or rewrite the chronicle — on a model of your choice. Keeps your original.
[link "Share feedback" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdxdqOhb1SQvI3fs50gMJv_Cesh2MuxUm95QO2iZia5sFhyyQ/viewform?usp=header"] [link "Buy me a coffee" href="https://buymeacoffee.com/kochitusker"]"
`;

exports[`audio add-on installed, everything configured > Settings search narrows the sections > search "whisper" 1`] = `
"Jump to
[button "Transcription"]
[searchbox "Search settings" value="whisper" placeholder="Search settings… e.g. api key, persona, whisper" type=search]
New here? Let us set it up for you
Walks through the configuration that works best, and shows you exactly what it will change before changing anything.
[button "Guided setup"]
  [summary "TranscriptionInstalledTurning recorded audio into a transcript — the one feature that installs.3" open] TranscriptionInstalledTurning recorded audio into a transcript — the one feature that installs.3
  Add-ons
  Features that put real bytes on disk live here. Everything else — personas, local runners, the CLI bridges, the Obsidian lore source — is part of the app and configured from its own panel.
  Audio TranscriptionEnabled
  Whisper sidecar and the Sessions tab.
  [button "Read docs"]
  [switch "On" checked] On
  [button "Uninstall"]
  Whisper Audio TranscriptionInstalled
  Whisper is ready. Upload Craig recordings from the Sessions tab and transcribe them locally.
  [button "Read the Audio Transcription docs"]
  [button "Uninstall"]
    [summary "whisper.cpp bridge (your own build)ExperimentalNot foundNot set up — no binary or model paths saved yet. Point the panel at your whisper.cpp build and a model file." closed] whisper.cpp bridge (your own build)ExperimentalNot foundNot set up — no binary or model paths saved yet. Point the panel at your whisper.cpp build and a model file. [button "Check again"]
    whisper.cpp bridge [button "About the whisper.cpp bridge" expanded=false]
    Not set up
    Checking…
    Path to the whisper.cpp executable
    [textbox "Path to the whisper.cpp executable" value="" placeholder="C:\\\\dev\\\\whisper.cpp\\\\build\\\\bin\\\\Release\\\\whisper-cli.exe"]
    Path to the GGML model file
    [textbox "Path to the GGML model file" value="" placeholder="C:\\\\dev\\\\whisper.cpp\\\\models\\\\ggml-large-v3.bin"]
    Both must be full paths. Anything under 20 MB is rejected — that's almost always a Git-LFS pointer rather than the real weights.
    [button "Save and check" disabled] [button "Re-check"]
    While this is set up and working, audio transcription uses whisper.cpp instead of the built-in engine. If anything here stops checking out, it falls back automatically rather than failing your run."
`;

