    [textbox "Password" value=<empty>]
    [button "Save"]
    Recommended routing
    Based on the probed capability of each detected local model, its parameter count, and whatever VRAM the legacy Hardware profile reports. Apply via Plan & routing below.
    Phase 1 — GroundingCloudNo local backend detected — every phase routes to cloud.
    Phase 2 — AuditCloudNo local backend detected — every phase routes to cloud.
    Phase 3 — ChronicleCloudNo local backend detected — every phase routes to cloud.
    Phase 4 — ExtrasCloudNo local backend detected — every phase routes to cloud.
    [summary "Plan & routing— Pick a plan, or set each phase's model yourself." closed] Plan & routing— Pick a plan, or set each phase's model yourself.
    Gemini Pro everywherebaseline [button "About Gemini Pro everywhere" expanded=false] [button "Apply" disabled]
    The newest top-tier model on all five phases, including the mechanical ones. The yardstick every saving below is measured against.
    Needs a Gemini, Claude, or OpenAI API key.
    Gemini Pro prose + free grounding~40% cheaperestimated [button "About Gemini Pro prose + free grounding" expanded=false] [button "Apply" disabled]
    Chronicle and condense on Gemini Pro; grounding and audit move to Claude Code at no API cost.
    Needs a Gemini key plus the Claude Code or Codex CLI on this machine.
    OpenRouter prose + free grounding~94% cheaperestimated [button "About OpenRouter prose + free grounding" expanded=false] [button "Apply" disabled]
    Chronicle, extras and condense on OpenRouter; grounding and audit on Claude Code at no API cost. No Gemini key needed.
    Needs an OpenRouter key plus the Claude Code or Codex CLI on this machine.
    OpenRouter everywhere~93% cheaperestimated [button "About OpenRouter everywhere" expanded=false] [button "Apply" disabled]
    All five phases on OpenRouter, each on the best model measured for that phase. One key, nothing else.
    Needs an OpenRouter key.
    Gemini Flash everywhere~77% cheapermeasuredRecommended [button "About Gemini Flash everywhere" expanded=false] [button "Apply" disabled]
    All five phases on the latest Gemini Flash — the configuration that matched Pro in blind testing.
    Needs a Gemini key.
    Claude Code everywhereno API cost [button "About Claude Code everywhere" expanded=false] [button "Apply" disabled]
    All five phases run on Claude Code. No API keys, no per-token cost at all.
    Needs the Claude Code or Codex CLI installed and signed in.
    [button "Clear overrides" disabled] [button "Save" disabled]
    No cloud API key configured. Add one in the API Keys card above to enable per-phase overrides.
  [summary "Pipeline tuningOptional quality and cost adjustments. All default to off.1" closed] Pipeline tuningOptional quality and cost adjustments. All default to off.1
  Pipeline tuning
  Optional adjustments to output quality and cost. Every one defaults to off — your runs behave exactly as they do today until you change something here.
  [checkbox "Send only relevant lore to Chronicle and Condense−92% lore sentBoth steps receive just the notes your session mentions, instead of your whole vault." unchecked] Send only relevant lore to Chronicle and Condense−92% lore sent [button "About lore retrieval" expanded=false] Both steps receive just the notes your session mentions, instead of your whole vault.
  [checkbox "Reassemble fragmented quotesquotes 70% → 93% completeLets the Extras phase rejoin split speech into complete sentences before quoting it." unchecked] Reassemble fragmented quotesquotes 70% → 93% complete [button "About quote reassembly" expanded=false] Lets the Extras phase rejoin split speech into complete sentences before quoting it.
  [checkbox "Use lore aliases to catch misheard namesno extra costGrounding gets phonetic hints from your lore index, for names transcription mangles." unchecked] Use lore aliases to catch misheard namesno extra cost [button "About alias hints" expanded=false] Grounding gets phonetic hints from your lore index, for names transcription mangles.
  [summary "Voice & contentThe voice your chronicle is written in, and what the models may filter.2" closed] Voice & contentThe voice your chronicle is written in, and what the models may filter.2
